737
00:41:25,300 --> 00:41:26,720
and they have no job.

738
00:41:26,720 --> 00:41:28,140
They just have a whole bunch

739
00:41:28,140 --> 00:41:28,700
of ministries,

740
00:41:28,700 --> 00:41:30,140
and so we've tried

741
00:41:30,140 --> 00:41:30,840
to support them.

742
00:41:31,200 --> 00:41:33,340
They work in Andhra Pradesh.

743
00:41:33,340 --> 00:41:35,880
60 million peoples

744
00:41:35,880 --> 00:41:36,760
live in the state

745
00:41:36,760 --> 00:41:38,440
of Andhra Pradesh in India.

746
00:41:38,440 --> 00:41:41,380
91.4% are Hindu.

747
00:41:41,380 --> 00:41:44,300
7.1% are Muslim.

748
00:41:44,300 --> 00:41:48,200
Only 1.3% of the people there

749
00:41:48,200 --> 00:41:50,540
