750
00:41:50,540 --> 00:41:53,280
And I have to ask the question,

751
00:41:53,280 --> 00:41:56,540
do they live the name of Jesus?

752
00:41:56,540 --> 00:41:58,920
It's kind of the same question

753
00:41:58,920 --> 00:41:59,880
I'm asking you today.

754
00:42:01,100 --> 00:42:03,380
Do we live the name of Jesus?

755
00:42:03,380 --> 00:42:05,680
Or do we shrink our cosmos?

756
00:42:05,680 --> 00:42:10,540
Well, the executive director,

757
00:42:10,540 --> 00:42:12,520
when he spoke to that church,

758
00:42:12,520 --> 00:42:13,900
he thought,

759
00:42:13,900 --> 00:42:14,840
I can only do one thing

760
00:42:14,840 --> 00:42:15,600
in 90 seconds.

761
00:42:15,600 --> 00:42:18,200
Maybe I can prod them

762
00:42:18,200 --> 00:42:19,500
to pray

763
00:42:19,500 --> 00:42:23,000
for the billions of people

764
00:42:23,000 --> 00:42:23,780
who need Jesus

765
00:42:23,780 --> 00:42:27,560
and to pray for some of the laborers

766
00:42:27,560 --> 00:42:28,560
and to pray for some of the laborers

767
00:42:28,560 --> 00:42:30,700
who are kupane,

768
00:42:30,700 --> 00:42:32,840
who are laboring to exhaustion

769
00:42:32,840 --> 00:42:36,480
to bring the gospel of Jesus Christ

770
00:42:36,480 --> 00:42:39,200
to the people who God loves,

771
00:42:39,200 --> 00:42:41,080
who God says,

772
00:42:41,080 --> 00:42:41,500
them.

773
00:42:41,500 --> 00:42:42,540
